<title>HONG KONG: BZW sets call warrants on Taiwan telecoms basket.</title>
<headline>BZW sets call warrants on Taiwan telecoms basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd said on Monday it proposed to issue 10 million American-style U.S. dollar composite call warrants on a basket of Taiwan telecommunications stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises:</p>
<p> Pacific Wire &amp; Cable		  2 shares</p>
<p> Huaeng Wire &amp; Cable		   2 shares</p>
<p> Microelectronics			1 share</p>
<p> Tecom Co				  1 share</p>
<p> Aurora Corp			     2 shares</p>
<p>One warrant controls one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	US$7.54	PREMIUM	 13.9 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 US$1.05	GEARING	 7.2X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  09.SEP.97    PAYDATE	 06.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     LUXEMBOURG   MIN EXER LOT  1,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    US$7.54</p>
<p> NOTE		  CASH SETTLEMENT ONLY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
